From: Paul Philippov <paul@themactep.com>
Subject: [PATCH] media: i2c: enable the Thingino T31 sensor drivers

Add the Kconfig and Makefile entries for the mainline V4L2 subdev drivers
ported from the Ingenic T31 vendor sensor modules, and register the JX
Imaging DT vendor prefix.

The drivers are selected per camera by open-tx-isp from the sensor name,
so only the driver a board needs is built into the kernel.

WARNING: only the SC2336 driver has been validated on hardware. The other
drivers in this series are register-level ports from the Ingenic vendor
sources and have not been tested on a camera.

Signed-off-by: Paul Philippov <paul@themactep.com>
---
--- a/drivers/media/i2c/Kconfig
+++ b/drivers/media/i2c/Kconfig
@@ -843,6 +843,226 @@
 	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the
 	  module will be called sc2336.
 
